# Per build spec §1: this file excludes ONLY these four entries.
#
# data/raw/, data/evidence/, data/interim/review_queue.*, and
# logs/pull_manifest.csv are COMMITTED, NOT ignored. Per §0.5 ("committed or
# gone"), cloud sessions get a fresh VM and anything uncommitted is destroyed
# when the session ends. Gitignoring the raw landing zone -- the usual
# convention -- would silently destroy the audit trail between sessions and
# make the pipeline non-reproducible. Do not add data directories here.

.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron
